## 重要声明 / Important Notice

### 数据集不上传 / Dataset Not Uploaded

**本项目的 GitHub 仓库不包含原始数据集文件。**

The original dataset files are NOT included in this GitHub repository.

原始数据集文件（`*.csv`、`*.npz`、`*.pkl`）已通过 `.gitignore` 排除，不会被上传到 GitHub。

Raw dataset files (`*.csv`, `*.npz`, `*.pkl`) are excluded via `.gitignore` and will not be uploaded to GitHub.

### 获取数据集 / Obtain the Dataset

如需复现本项目分析，请从阿里云天池平台下载原始数据集：

To reproduce this project, please download the original dataset from Alibaba Cloud Tianchi:

1. 访问 / Visit: https://tianchi.aliyun.com/dataset/dataDetail?dataId=649
2. 注册/登录阿里云天池账号 / Register/Login to Tianchi account
3. 下载数据集 / Download the dataset
4. 将文件重命名为 `UserBehavior.csv` / Rename file to `UserBehavior.csv`
5. 放置在项目根目录 / Place in project root directory
6. 运行 `notebook/data_cleaning.ipynb` 进行数据清洗 / Run `notebook/data_cleaning.ipynb` for data cleaning

